# --registry twice
$ skills validate --registry <WORLD>/other/skills.registry.yaml --registry <WORLD>/skills.registry.yaml --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
registry and manifest aligned (4 skills)
skills/ on disk matches overlay.manifest (4 files)
global skill approvals verified (3 skills: 3 approved, 0 grandfathered)
--- stderr ---

# --manifest twice, the last is missing
$ skills validate --manifest <WORLD>/overlay.manifest --manifest <WORLD>/absent.manifest --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: reading manifest "<WORLD>/absent.manifest": open <WORLD>/absent.manifest: no such file or directory

# --source-root twice, the last is the one that is read
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/nowhere --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
